{"4806670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Whitopia", "steam_appid": 4806670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/19d0d9ac35f860b173283eed9fb90079.avif?t=1788299543\" width=1500 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/6d5b0b77c49cad1c6c0532ce89e32c5e.avif?t=1788299543\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">White is not just a color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> White is the rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> White is the purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/f37039ab8ffb661bfe3d3f60a0dcf276.poster.avif?t=1788299543\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/f37039ab8ffb661bfe3d3f60a0dcf276.webm?t=1788299543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/f37039ab8ffb661bfe3d3f60a0dcf276.mp4?t=1788299543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/62749dbb66f20baa13cb9ddd83a32db5.avif?t=1788299543\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this strange and relaxing short painting game, your mission is simple: remove every trace of color from the world. Graffiti, clutter, bright objects, messy walls, and anything that dares to stand out must be covered in pure white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Paint everything. Remove the mess. Eradicate color.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/c9b687aeb8cf20a967f98da28c9fe6ca.poster.avif?t=1788299543\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/c9b687aeb8cf20a967f98da28c9fe6ca.webm?t=1788299543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/c9b687aeb8cf20a967f98da28c9fe6ca.mp4?t=1788299543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/e1fef0394c7638f36ab8b04449bc7ce6.avif?t=1788299543\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Armed with your painting tool, you will explore different areas and restore order by erasing every colorful detail you find. The more color you remove, the more rewards you earn. Use them to unlock new gadgets, upgrades, and perks that make your work faster, cleaner, and more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/8ff47e9c8d519d150a22e9e6d12f0660.poster.avif?t=1788299543\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/8ff47e9c8d519d150a22e9e6d12f0660.webm?t=1788299543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/8ff47e9c8d519d150a22e9e6d12f0660.mp4?t=1788299543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/19d0d9ac35f860b173283eed9fb90079.avif?t=1788299543\" width=1500 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/6d5b0b77c49cad1c6c0532ce89e32c5e.avif?t=1788299543\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">White is not just a color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> White is the rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> White is the purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/f37039ab8ffb661bfe3d3f60a0dcf276.poster.avif?t=1788299543\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/f37039ab8ffb661bfe3d3f60a0dcf276.webm?t=1788299543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/f37039ab8ffb661bfe3d3f60a0dcf276.mp4?t=1788299543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/62749dbb66f20baa13cb9ddd83a32db5.avif?t=1788299543\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this strange and relaxing short painting game, your mission is simple: remove every trace of color from the world. Graffiti, clutter, bright objects, messy walls, and anything that dares to stand out must be covered in pure white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Paint everything. Remove the mess. Eradicate color.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/c9b687aeb8cf20a967f98da28c9fe6ca.poster.avif?t=1788299543\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/c9b687aeb8cf20a967f98da28c9fe6ca.webm?t=1788299543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/c9b687aeb8cf20a967f98da28c9fe6ca.mp4?t=1788299543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4806670/extras/e1fef0394c7638f36ab8b04449bc7ce6.avif?t=1788299543\" width=1500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Armed with your painting tool, you will explore different areas and restore order by erasing every colorful detail you find. The more color you remove, the more rewards you earn. Use them to unlock new gadgets, upgrades, and perks that make your work faster, cleaner, and more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4